earth: a week where {aim.doing} takes every evening: calls to return, people to see, a plan to keep
tribal: a moon when {N} carries the work for {aim.thing} from fire to fire, and the hunting waits
magic: a week when the guild's letters about {aim.thing} all pass through {Ns} hands, and the lamp burns late
scene: The others look to {N} now to keep things moving: calls to return, people to see, a plan that only holds if someone holds it. This week {aim.doing} has taken every evening, and the people at home have noticed.
scene tribal: The clan looks to {N} now to carry the work for {aim.thing} from fire to fire. This moon there has been no time for the hunt, and {Ns} family has noticed.
scene magic: Every letter the guild sends about {aim.thing} passes through {Ns} hands now. The lamp in {Ns} room has burned past midnight every night this week.
- W | keep to the plan the group agreed, one task at a time, however long it takes | v: conformity, security | aim: work | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 80
- U | rework the plan so it needs fewer evenings from fewer people | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 70
- B | hand the small jobs to others and keep only the calls that matter | v: power, achievement | aim: work | foot: person patron | chance: 65
- R | throw every evening at it this week and sleep when it is done | v: stimulation, achievement | aim: work | foot: means health-.04 | chance: 65
- G | keep two evenings free for home, whatever the week brings | v: benevolence, security | aim: ease | foot: means ties+.04 | chance: 85
- W>B | ask the group to name a deputy, and train them properly | v: conformity, power | aim: ease | foot: person colleague | chance: 75
- U>R | try a new way of reaching people that nobody here has tried | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 55
- B>G | take the lead in public, and let the old hands run things quietly | v: power, tradition | aim: work | foot: person elder | chance: 65
- R>W | promise the group the hardest part of the plan, and do it in the open | v: stimulation, conformity | aim: work | foot: door kept your word | chance: 70
- G>U | step back for a month and watch how the group manages alone | v: tradition, self-direction | aim: ease | foot: lesson the work goes on without you | chance: 80
works: The week ends with the plan still standing and more hands on it than before.
works: Somebody new picks up a task without being asked, and {N} lets them.
fails: Two things slip in the same week, and the calls pile up.
fails: The plan holds, but home feels every evening that went into it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- cause, contest (a test), rungs 0 1 (cycle s1)

== three minutes to speak at {aim.contest}
tier: life event
shape: cause
kind: contest
rungs: 0 1
fork:
stages: juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 12-85
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: mixed
life: community, public life
horizon: week
roles: mentor, elder, rival, neighbour
earth: {aim.contest} where the small group's case is heard, and anyone may speak for three minutes
tribal: the gathering of the clan where anyone may stand and speak for {aim.thing}
magic: the open sitting of the guild where any member may speak for {aim.thing}
scene: The date for {aim.contest} is set, and the small group {N} joined has one chance to be heard before it. Anyone may speak for three minutes, and the list of speakers closes tonight.
scene tribal: The clan gathers at the full moon, and anyone may stand and speak for {aim.thing}. {N} has never stood up in the circle before.
scene magic: The guild holds its open sitting at the turn of the season, and any member may speak for {aim.thing}. {N} has never said a word there.
- W | put your name on the list and speak to the facts the group agreed | v: conformity, universalism | aim: try | foot: place rule.voice | chance: 65
- U | prepare one clear point and the figures behind it, and time it to the second | v: achievement, self-direction | aim: try | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 60
- B | ask to speak last, so this is the point the room remembers | v: power, achievement | aim: try | foot: person rival | chance: 55
- R | speak from the heart about why it matters, notes or no notes | v: stimulation, universalism | aim: try | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 55
- G | let an older member speak this time, and stand beside them while they do | v: tradition, benevolence | aim: skip | foot: person elder | chance: 85
- W>U | sit in the front row and take careful notes for the group | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: skip | foot: lesson see how it is done first | chance: 90
- U>B | help the main speaker sharpen their words, and let them take the floor | v: achievement, power | aim: skip | foot: person colleague | chance: 85
- B>R | ask the hardest question of the evening from the back of the room | v: power, stimulation | aim: try | foot: mark defied an authority | chance: 50
- R>G | bring the whole street along so the room is full of faces | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: try | foot: means ties+.05 | chance: 65
- G>W | stay home this time and help the group write its next letter | v: security, conformity | aim: skip | foot: lesson the speaking rests on quiet work | chance: 90
works: {Ns} point goes into the record, and someone on the other side nods.
works: The group is heard, and the matter is put off to be looked at again, which is a start.
fails: The room is half empty, and the decision is made before anyone speaks.
fails: {N} loses the thread halfway, and the three minutes run out.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- cause, contest (a test), rungs 2 3 4 (cycle s2)

== the day {aim.contest} settles it
tier: life event
shape: cause
kind: contest
rungs: 2 3 4
fork:
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 18-85
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: mixed
life: community, public life
horizon: months
roles: colleague, rival, elder, mentor
earth: {aim.contest} that will settle what years of {aim.doing} have built toward
tribal: the great gathering of the clans where the matter of {aim.thing} is settled
magic: the high council's sitting where the guild's long case for {aim.thing} is decided
scene: After months of work, {aim.contest} is next week, and what is decided there will stand for years. {aim.person} has asked to meet the night before, and the other side has been busy too.
scene tribal: The clans gather once in a generation to settle the matter of {aim.thing}, and the elders will listen to whoever speaks for it. Everyone expects {N} to.
scene magic: The high council sits on the guild's long case for {aim.thing} at the next new moon. Whoever speaks for it speaks in front of the whole court.
- W | go through the proper channels to the last form, and let the case speak | v: conformity, security | aim: try | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 60
- U | spend the week answering every point the other side could raise | v: achievement, self-direction | aim: try | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 60
- B | meet the undecided ones one by one before the day | v: power, achievement | aim: try | foot: person go-between | chance: 55
- R | gather everyone who cares outside on the day, peacefully, to be seen and heard | v: stimulation, universalism | aim: try | foot: place gather.great | chance: 55
- G | ask the people the decision touches to tell it in their own words | v: benevolence, universalism | aim: try | foot: person neighbour | chance: 60
- W>B | agree a fair compromise in advance with the other side's leaders | v: conformity, power | aim: try | foot: door kept your word | chance: 65
- U>R | say out loud the one thing everyone has been too careful to say | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: try | foot: mark defied an authority | chance: 45
- B>G | let the oldest names in town carry it, and stand where they can see you | v: power, tradition | aim: try | foot: person elder | chance: 55
- R>W | step aside so a newer voice can take this one, and back them all the way | v: benevolence, conformity | aim: skip | foot: person friend | chance: 85
- G>U | hold back this round, and gather what you learn for the next one | v: security, self-direction | aim: skip | foot: lesson the right time matters | chance: 85
works: The decision goes their way, and the first thing {N} feels is tired.
works: Not everything they asked for, but the part that matters is written down and agreed.
fails: It goes the other way by a narrow margin, and the room empties fast.
fails: The decision is put off again, and the work has to start over in the spring.

