horizon: months
roles: mentor, elder, friend
earth: an older hand at {aim.doing} who has seen it won and lost more than once
tribal: an old one of the clan who spoke for {aim.thing} before {Ns} parents were born
magic: an old member of the guild who has worked for {aim.thing} under three masters
scene: {aim.person} has been {aim.doing} longer than {N} has been alive, and has seen it won and lost more than once. They have offered to show {N} how it is really done, if {N} can stand being told what not to do.
scene tribal: {elder} spoke for {aim.thing} at the fire before {Ns} parents were born. Now they offer to teach {N} which words work and which only feel good.
scene magic: An old member of the guild has worked for {aim.thing} under three masters, and offers to take {N} on as a second.
- W | do exactly what they say for a full year before questioning any of it | v: tradition, conformity | aim: work | foot: person mentor | chance: 80
- U | ask about every case they lost, and what they would do differently | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson the losses teach the most | chance: 75
- B | let them open the doors they know, and remember who stands behind each | v: power, achievement | aim: try | foot: person patron | chance: 60
- R | take what fits and argue with the rest, out loud | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: try | foot: mark defied an authority | chance: 55
- G | spend time with them away from the work, and let the teaching come slowly | v: benevolence, tradition | aim: ease | foot: person elder | chance: 85
- W>U | write down what they teach, so it can be passed on | v: tradition, self-direction | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 85
- U>B | learn how they read a room, and use it at the next meeting | v: achievement, power | aim: try | foot: means ties+.04 | chance: 60
- B>R | ask them to put you in front of the people who decide, now | v: power, stimulation | aim: try | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 45
- R>G | follow them on their rounds and simply listen to the people they meet | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: ease | foot: person neighbour | chance: 80
- G>W | thank them, and keep to the slower pace your own life allows | v: benevolence, security | aim: ease | foot: lesson a good teacher can wait | chance: 90
works: {aim.person} says less each time, and {N} needs less telling.
works: One thing {N} learned from them saves a whole month of wasted work.
fails: The two of them rub each other the wrong way, and the lessons stop after a few weeks.
fails: {aim.person} is too busy this season, and the offer goes quiet.

