earth: a hard loss for {aim.thing}: the answer was no, the money ran out, or the people drifted away
tribal: a season when the clan turns its back on {aim.thing} and the fires that spoke for it go quiet
magic: a ruling of the court against {aim.thing}, and the guild's patrons quietly withdrawing
scene: Something {N} worked toward for a long stretch has fallen through: the answer was no, the money ran out, or the people drifted away. {friend} asks, carefully, whether {N} is still going to the meetings.
scene tribal: The clan has turned its back on {aim.thing} this season, and the fires that spoke for it have gone quiet. {friend} asks whether {N} will still go.
scene magic: The court has ruled against {aim.thing}, and the guild's patrons have quietly stopped answering letters. {friend} asks what {N} means to do now.
- W | go back to the next meeting as if nothing has changed | v: conformity, tradition | aim: work | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 75
- U | sit down and work out, honestly, why it went the way it did | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson a loss shows where to look | chance: 70
- B | find out who blocked it, and plan how to get past them next time | v: power, achievement | aim: work | foot: person rival | chance: 55
- R | be angry for a week, then start again louder | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: work | foot: means health-.03 | chance: 60
- G | let it go, and keep the friends you made along the way | v: benevolence, security | aim: stop | foot: person friend | chance: 90
- W>U | keep the records safe, so whoever comes next can pick it up | v: tradition, universalism | aim: stop | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 85
- U>B | turn what you learned into advice that others will pay to hear | v: achievement, power | aim: work | foot: means money+.04 | chance: 60
- B>R | put on something nobody can ignore, peacefully, within the week | v: power, stimulation | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 45
- R>G | turn to other things for a month, then come back to it | v: stimulation, security | aim: work | foot: lesson rest is part of the work | chance: 80
- G>W | thank the neighbours who stayed, and close this chapter for good | v: benevolence, tradition | aim: stop | foot: person neighbour | chance: 85
works: The next meeting is small, but everyone there chose to come.
works: {N} finds the reason it failed, and it is one that can be fixed.
fails: The tiredness lasts longer than the anger did.
fails: Even the people who stayed are not sure what comes next.

