- G | step back to the edge for a year, and help when asked | v: security, benevolence | aim: ease | foot: means time+.05 | chance: 90
- W>B | hand over the running of it, and keep one seat at the table | v: conformity, power | aim: ease | foot: person colleague | chance: 80
- U>R | put on something public and joyful for it, where the dull meetings were | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: work | foot: place gather.great | chance: 55
- B>G | let it go, and keep the people who will still answer your calls | v: power, benevolence | aim: stop | foot: person friend | chance: 85
- R>W | say it plainly at the meeting: you are done, and here is what you learned | v: self-direction, conformity | aim: stop | foot: lesson knowing when to stop | chance: 85
- G>U | slow down, and spend the year learning how others broke through | v: tradition, self-direction | aim: ease | foot: lesson slow years can still teach | chance: 80
works: Something small shifts that would not have shifted without the extra year.
works: {N} chooses, and the choice feels like {Ns} own.
fails: The next year is the same as the last, only colder.
fails: The group frays a little, whatever {N} decides.

